{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Smack Monkey:</u> Never Stop Smacking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Reject humanity. Return to monkey.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Smack Monkey is a satisfying precision platformer where you climb fast! <i>(and fall even faster...)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191540/extras/MarcusIdle.gif?t=1741382200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mr. Marcus Monkey</strong>\u00a0slept in and is now late for his date with his hot monkey girlfriend!!!! <i>AAAAAAAAAAHHHHHH!!!!!</i> Jump, climb and smack your way to the top of <strong>Sunset Mountain</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>~Mr. Marcus Monkey has the shmoves~</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press <strong>&quot;Smack&quot;</strong> to do a horizontal smack jump on the ground or vines!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press <strong>&quot;Smack&quot;</strong> before you smash into a wall to do a vertical smack climb!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press <strong>&quot;Jump&quot;</strong> three times in succession to perform a triple jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you slip up however... You might tumble down! Save yourself from losing progress by smacking or jumping out of a slide, before it's too late!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191540/extras/ToucanTalk.gif?t=1741382200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your buddy <strong>Eric the Toucan</strong> will &quot;guide&quot; you on your quest to scaling Sunset Mountain. He also says mean things sometimes, but he's got a good heart. (At least, so I've been told...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191540/extras/CrocodileSleep.gif?t=1741382200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also... watch out for bananas, frostadiles, snakes and ice... They'll mess ya up!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to legendary classical tracks from the great minds of Debussy, Erik Satie and more,  performed live by a trained monkey on a marimba.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock different monkey colors by reaching the top fast enough!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also I heard that if you smack your way into hidden locations, you might even find a secret frog or two... <i>ribbit</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has speed running features! There's a built-in timer, an optional tutorial and variable endings based on completion time.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Strawberry Monkey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/43ed7560b05c6ccf52267c449276964127dbbb27.jpg"},{"name":"Banana Monkey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/2d45826cf65dbced5f348cb7b47438453860dfe0.jpg"},{"name":"Lime Monkey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/46894cd600640dc998a664763b7c9e3c14713509.jpg"},{"name":"Blueberry Monkey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/f6d82026621ca86f4a0b4d319ba3c43c45adc952.jpg"},{"name":"Plum Monkey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/7597eda3b8daa972a35ea5de24cf5e622cd4b1df.jpg"},{"name":"Snow Monkey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/5c120bef6d9f193ca1215630de8ac21882df7b9c.jpg"},{"name":"Midnight Monkey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/919089586df12898f7e107591fc956755dac5bf0.jpg"},{"name":"\"There's nothing like watching the sunset with you\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/c10b845ad5deb044625d633f8cb40fe57e8fb62a.jpg"},{"name":"\"The stars are so pretty tonight\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191540/7a1459b97493c45a691d18c471a37ebba47171c1.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3191540?t=1741382200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3191540?t=1741382200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191540/608573cadaef7ef7842807cf17eed5c6987ee018/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741382200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191540/608573cadaef7ef7842807cf17eed5c6987ee018/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741382200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3535080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Smack Monkey:</u> Never Stop Smacking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Reject humanity. Return to monkey.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Smack Monkey is a satisfying precision platformer where you climb fast! <i>(and fall even faster...)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191540/extras/MarcusIdle.gif?t=1741382200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mr. Marcus Monkey</strong>\u00a0slept in and is now late for his date with his hot monkey girlfriend!!!! <i>AAAAAAAAAAHHHHHH!!!!!</i> Jump, climb and smack your way to the top of <strong>Sunset Mountain</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>~Mr. Marcus Monkey has the shmoves~</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press <strong>&quot;Smack&quot;</strong> to do a horizontal smack jump on the ground or vines!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press <strong>&quot;Smack&quot;</strong> before you smash into a wall to do a vertical smack climb!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press <strong>&quot;Jump&quot;</strong> three times in succession to perform a triple jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you slip up however... You might tumble down! Save yourself from losing progress by smacking or jumping out of a slide, before it's too late!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191540/extras/ToucanTalk.gif?t=1741382200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your buddy <strong>Eric the Toucan</strong> will &quot;guide&quot; you on your quest to scaling Sunset Mountain. He also says mean things sometimes, but he's got a good heart. (At least, so I've been told...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191540/extras/CrocodileSleep.gif?t=1741382200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also... watch out for bananas, frostadiles, snakes and ice... They'll mess ya up!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to legendary classical tracks from the great minds of Debussy, Erik Satie and more,  performed live by a trained monkey on a marimba.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock different monkey colors by reaching the top fast enough!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also I heard that if you smack your way into hidden locations, you might even find a secret frog or two... <i>ribbit</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has speed running features! There's a built-in timer, an optional tutorial and variable endings based on completion time.</p></li></ul>","developers":["DrDrub"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.